  "title": "Tubelox 220 Pc Building & Construction Kids Toy Set w/Storage Bag (Open Box)",
  "handle": "tubelox-220-pc-building-construction-kids-toy-set-w-storage-bag-open-box",
  "body_html": "<p>####Item is open box, unharmed and in very good condition. All accessories or parts are included with the item.####</p><p><br></p><ul>\n<li>Building and construction toy set includes 220 pieces that will enhance creative and imaginative play</li>\n<li>STEM toy (Science, Technology, Engineering, Math) for educational applications to have fun while learning</li>\n<li>Ideal for indoors and outdoors, kids will love inventing their own cars, doll houses, jungle gyms, rocket ships, and more</li>\n<li>Encourages active play to build communication and social skills with rules, patience, and teamwork</li>\n<li>High-quality construction with secure attachment pieces and locking adapters provide increased durability that supports kids up to 75 pounds</li>\n<li>Toy set is easy to use, and pieces connect with ease for children ages 3 and older to play with</li>\n<li>Includes a convenient bag for simple storage and easy transportation</li>\n<li>Deluxe set includes 38 standard tubes, 12 half tubes, 4 orange panels, 4 green elbows, 12 blue 4-way prongs, 10 red tees, 4 wheels, 34 yellow clips, 14 green clips, 6 orange clips, 52 blue clips, 6 red clips, 4 yellow hubs, 2 orange pivot tees, 4 green connectors, 4 elbow tubes, 4 green 3-way connectors, 4 blue 4-way crosses, and 5 green 5-way prongs</li>\n<li>Number of pieces: 220</li>\n<li>Color: Multicolor</li>\n<li>Dimensions (L x W x H): 28 x 18 x 12 inches</li>\n<li>Weight: 34 pounds</li>\n<li>Product Condition: Open Box \u2013 Like new</li>\n<li>Product Sold As Is.</li>\n</ul>",
